{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-00138-00003","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["경제사업체계와 질서를 합리적으로 정돈","핵‧미사일 모라토리엄 철회로 새로운 도전을 시사"],"reason":"The economic measures and the moratorium withdrawal are covered. It omits the strategic-weapons development and the 'no denuclearization' stance, which are the core of the passage. The first sentence is a long run-on."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["무적의 군사력","새로운 전략무기를 선보일 것을 천명","모라토리엄 철회로 새로운 도전을 시사"],"reason":"It captures the defense goal, the new strategic weapons and the moratorium withdrawal. It leaves out the conditional on US hostile policy and the economic part, which are minor losses."},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":4,"evidence":["미국이 적대시 정책을 계속할 경우 ’조선반도의 비핵화‘는 없을 것","전략무기 개발을 계속 진행"],"reason":"It keeps the strategic-weapons continuation, the conditional on US hostile policy and the moratorium withdrawal. It omits the economic content and the expected ICBM and nuclear test outlook."},"D":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["지난해 4월 전원회의 이후 북한은 각종 단거리 미사일과 초대형 방사포 시험발사","핵·미사일 모라토리엄 철회로 새로운 도전을 시사"],"reason":"It says North Korea will continue development and tests 'after the plenary meeting'. The source places the plenary meeting in the past, when the missile tests were already happening. This is a time-frame distortion. It also leaves out the US-conditional and the reasons behind the moratorium withdrawal."}}}
